e that these charms are connected to Heavenly Host Academy—an elementary school that was destroyed years ago after a series of gruesome murders took place, a school that rests under the foundation of their very own Kisaragi Academy. Now, trapped in an alternate dimension with vengeful ghosts of the past, the students must work together to escape—or join the spirits of the damned forever.\n\nA feast for mystery fanatics, gore-hounds, and horror fans alike, Corpse Party: Tortured Souls - Bougyakusareta Tamashii no Jukyou shows a sobering look at redemption, sacrifice, and how the past is always right behind, sometimes a little too close for comfort.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Ghost","rank":99,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":95,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Alternate Universe","rank":81,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Body Horror","rank":80,"spoiler":true},{"name":"School","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Memory Manipulation","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Isekai","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Skeleton","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Suicide","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Time Manipulation","rank":50,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Survival","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Curses","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Exorcism","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Revenge","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Torture","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Corpse Party","english":"Corpse Party","native":"コープスパーティー Tortured Souls -暴虐された魂の呪叫-","romaji":"Corpse Party: Tortured Souls - Bougyakusareta Tamashii no Jukyou","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"尸体派对 Tortured Souls"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"尸骸派对 被诅咒的灵魂"},{"language":null,"sou